* Lil Delirium can transform into the same familiar multiple times in a row and therefore stay in the same form for more than 10 seconds.
* Every time Lil Delirium transforms from a free-floating familiar to a follower one, it positions itself at the end of the familiar train.
* Lil Delirium can damage Isaac when transformed into BBF or Bob's Brain.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Familiar]]s that follow behind Isaac have a certain priority in how close their position is to him over other familiars. Lil Delirium starts at {{dlc|nr+}} 4th / {{dlc|r+}} 6th priority regardless of the familiar it transforms into as long as it starts as a familiar that follows behind Isaac. When Lil Delirium changes out of a familiar that follows behind Isaac; its priority resets and becomes equal to its next form (e.g. having {{dlc|nr+}} 2nd / {{dlc|r+}} 3rd priority when its next form is [[File:Lil Delirium Incubus.png|20x20px|link=Incubus]]). Changing from one following familiar to another will not change priorities.
