== Bugs ==
{{bug|When entering a new floor or room, Lil Delirium and a normal familiar you have can swap forms as long as Lil Delirium is currently transformed as that familiar. For example, if you have {{i|Lil Brimstone|n}} and Lil Delirium, Lil Brimstone will become Lil Delirium's form, while Lil Delirium will look normal. This persists for the other familiar, but Lil Delirium will go back to normal. This also works if you pick up the familiar Lil Delirium is transformed as.{{reconfirm}}}}

